<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>Retriever and reranker model information based on HuggingFace model cards <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib52" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wolf et al., 2020</a>)</cite>. For each model, we list the number of parameters, number languages it was trained on, and which of the CIRAL and CLEF languages are not supported. For bi-encoders we also report the embedding size.</figcaption>
